msgstr ""

#: ../../../user/downloading-installing-upgrading/installation-guide.rst:162
#: e0b135384c0649f3babe85796dd0867a
msgid ""
"The Qubes OS installer is completely offline. It doesn’t even load any "
"networking drivers, so there is no possibility of internet-based data leaks "
"or attacks during the installation process."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../user/downloading-installing-upgrading/installation-guide.rst:164
#: f58ede68764c4cc6860ae553ec41f1b1
msgid ""
"The Installation summary screen allows you to change how the system will be "
"installed and configured, including localization settings. At minimum, you "
